|entry[2026-08-05-founding] :date <2026-08-05> :by joseph+claude
  :scope whole project
  Project founded. Notes gathered estate-wide (grok agent) and extended with live-state
  health reports, vivarium orientation-gate and build-issues notes (claude). Concern
  structure iterated to 15 chapters in three parts; converted to the canonical segment
  outline at plan/OUTLINE.md — declared the very last ad-hoc verisectorium, trialing
  tradeoffs (no slug type-prefixes, expected-vs-actual type columns, state-first,
  wikilink tags). ONTOLOGY.un, PRACTICA, this changelog, HANDOFF created. notes/ moved
  to plan/INFLUX/ awaiting processing; plan/.integrated and plan/.archive created empty.
  Also adjudicated the tst-grounding report against ASF primaries (verdict: faithful;
  the junk was its downstream P*-slogan compression, already deleted 2026-07-31 in udon
  theory) — no banners needed.
